    "display_name": "Neuroscience",
    "long_instructions": "## Talk to a Neuroscientist\r\n\r\n### Do This:\r\n\r\n1. Ask the neuroscientist for a few examples of how work in their field has contributed to the development of AI.\r\n2. Pick an example that you find interesting and ask for details to complete the questions in your Activity Guide.\r\n\r\n::: details [**Not sure what to ask?**]\r\nTry a prompt like this:\r\n> What are some examples of innovations in neuroscience that have helped develop AI?\r\n:::",
